<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-05T11:16:51.491Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 11:16:51 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen abducted six mourners on a Benue highway and later abandoned a corpse, while separate gunmen killed a pastor, three others and injured eight in a community raid in Benue. In Kaduna a fresh attack left two dead and 20 people kidnapped, and security agencies later rescued eight abducted victims, while bandits killed a pregnant woman, a soldier and a hunter and abducted fifteen people in Taraba. A suspect was arrested for the attack on Peter Obi’s convoy in Calabar. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxObXV6MGtFZkFOYzgzZElZalBkdzQyeVg2cmcwLWRURmZLTEhsZ0J1dWpvQzE5eFVFZ05qN2M4SktHR3diYnN4Wk1HQlVheS1LN1NUNDIxcWY1R1lBX1pJUHVuVE4tdUc3bUtyWXB6WXRZdldudkNsTDVDVU9qOXRybkNxQ2dvVGlfVTNWN2tIdl8wemMyQUxhTlc4aFZnWGdXYVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNRmV0c2JFZDBGdDZKaUwzcGRKSDlZU2lMc0FiVERKZDlWSGxiWHpRN2JBVzhaeVBlVDdiUGtTV0xDUmRZQ21JZGNiLVk3ZGxKVzM4NU1nMGxLRDRPa242VF9KS3BvZzlsYXRlb1R5REp3eW42dmloa0NrUnAtZDE1eVMzQVhHWldpaHlTZUp5cjdHYVVBSXpB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Galaxy Television&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business News Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOQnhuYlF0U3BRSlo1OWJNbXZ2WXVCb2tVX2dqZjk3c3hiUU11R1RIcVJreG9SU0FlQ2FZbTJGWkFpcUUxN25QbUdfVkkwYldCZV9udWN4ZjFyQTRNb3J6aDBNR1V2TlotNGJPVUFnWFpUbWl3YTZQbHpEVnRZb3BKT2NxNGFNZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Eye&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNaXM2aWpTNXJ1NFdwblhjdHYyQ0xaNlZMMFNJdmNLWm5DdExoUXVDcDdHa09xY3ZiTENZSGttbmxPdjNIM3dqZFd3WmFUSXdjY0ZlZTY0Mk8wLXBhbmxZb3N1eGZCdXhsVWxuV2tLeEtRZGNTZG83ZlNEWEJBd0VMYll6THN0SG1YSWZ5X0VoSGk4dkFZU2dSelNnTGZSQTA?oc=5&quot;&